stepTemplate.prompt:
You are running inside bullswarm. The pool that selected you is {{item}}. The model you are using is whatever this CLI defaults to. Answer this research question thoroughly with citations from the repo at {{inputs.targetDir}}:

{{inputs.question}}

Return a markdown response. Sign it with: 'Answered by pool={{item}}, model=<your model id>' so we can attribute the answer.

steps.prompt:
Read the per-pool research files. Their paths are stored in this comma-separated list:

{{inputs.poolFiles}}

For each one, append a one-paragraph critique covering: (1) one-sentence summary, (2) cited coverage of the 10 gap closures between bullswarm v0.4.0 and v0.5.0, (3) any unique insight the other models missed. End with a ranked top-3 list and a one-paragraph synthesis. Sign with 'Synthesizer model=<your model id>'.
